  "description": "EVOSIV crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C116 H90 Cl6 N12 O16 Yb4. From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb11 (Yb) has 7 O neighbors; Yb3 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb4 (Yb) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.490-3.787 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.99-111.22°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C116H90Cl6N12O16Yb4. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
